        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="l-footer-bottom">
        <p>&copy; 2026 CV Builder by Stuzzicadenti AG. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p class="l-footer-privacy">Your data stays in your browser. We respect your privacy.</p>
